  "text": "Regional transit depot. The checkpoint manifest matches these shipments. Every outgoing convoy feeds the occupation. We followed their supply line. Now we find where it thinks for them. Their lights reach every doorway. Stay beneath the rail deck. I'll keep the runoff from giving us away. Steel remembers every footstep. Keep close. I'll take the weight where the old supports are failing. The communication tower assigns patrol routes across this district. Reach its relay and sever the network. Those crates carry the same markings as the siege battery. This is how they keep every checkpoint supplied. We break the road they built for their machines. The people down there get a way through. One tower, one blind spot. Get me to the relay. We move together.",
